WEBVTT

00:08.050 --> 00:13.890
<i>This small room feels too big ever since 
Akutsu left for the human realm.</i>

00:14.470 --> 00:17.240
<i>I wonder if he's still going for it.</i>

00:20.160 --> 00:23.250
<i>That girl who was next to Akutsu...</i>

00:24.950 --> 00:26.750
Yes, Akutsu?

00:26.750 --> 00:27.810
What is it?

00:31.770 --> 00:33.830
Hello? Are you listening?

00:34.330 --> 00:35.720
<i>Yeah, just...</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:38.510
Akutsu? Is something the matter?

00:38.510 --> 00:40.700
<i>Yes, I'm listening.</i>

00:41.120 --> 00:43.140
<i>I just discovered an angel.</i>

00:43.140 --> 00:44.020
An angel?!

00:44.460 --> 00:46.300
It's dangerous to try to 
deal with them yourself.

00:46.300 --> 00:47.780
I'll send backup immediately.

00:47.780 --> 00:48.860
<i>Yes.</i>

00:49.260 --> 00:51.290
<i>I'm not an idiot.</i>

00:51.290 --> 00:53.340
<i>I wouldn't fight alone.</i>

00:53.790 --> 00:56.250
First, we need to make sure you're safe.

00:56.250 --> 00:56.980
<i>Yes.</i>

00:56.980 --> 00:58.820
<i>I'll get as far away as I can.</i>

00:59.230 --> 01:00.250
<i>Or...</i>

01:00.250 --> 01:02.120
<i>So I wish I could say!</i>

01:03.420 --> 01:04.400
Akutsu!

01:04.400 --> 01:06.330
<i>Oh, er...</i>

01:06.330 --> 01:07.680
<i>I regret to inform you...</i>

01:07.680 --> 01:08.660
What happened?

01:08.660 --> 01:10.340
<i>I've been found.</i>

01:10.900 --> 01:11.880
Pardon me.

02:55.510 --> 02:56.730
What's so funny?!

02:58.140 --> 02:59.410
I see.

02:59.860 --> 03:02.450
You never knew, huh?

03:02.890 --> 03:06.770
Wings are a symbol of an angel's power.

03:10.220 --> 03:13.290
Run, Amane!

03:21.930 --> 03:24.430
In other words...

03:25.640 --> 03:27.510
She's a fraud.

03:29.950 --> 03:31.610
You!

03:31.610 --> 03:33.440
You don't learn, do you?

03:33.810 --> 03:36.540
You aren't going to escape from them.

03:36.540 --> 03:37.690
Yup, yup.

03:37.690 --> 03:38.440
Shit!

03:39.700 --> 03:42.360
Those are practically bird feathers.

03:43.070 --> 03:45.620
You took the texts way too seriously.

03:46.300 --> 03:47.510
Have a look.

03:53.400 --> 03:55.450
Totally different.

03:56.340 --> 03:58.630
How far do you need to go?

04:00.630 --> 04:07.560
You dashed her pride, humiliated her, and...

04:16.740 --> 04:18.050
Tarnished her!

04:23.080 --> 04:27.910
Sounds like you struggled so hard 
you broke something.

04:55.100 --> 04:55.810
You!

05:09.690 --> 05:10.450
Hold him!

05:11.890 --> 05:12.750
Yes!

05:28.300 --> 05:29.640
Damn you!

05:33.660 --> 05:35.680
Wretched demon!

05:46.570 --> 05:48.190
What is that?

05:50.090 --> 05:50.890
So fast!

05:53.290 --> 05:54.400
Nii-sama!

05:59.240 --> 06:02.650
I've never heard of demons having such a thing!

06:03.350 --> 06:05.080
What are those...

06:06.110 --> 06:07.950
black wings?

06:10.150 --> 06:12.410
<i>I've never heard anything about this...</i>

06:12.720 --> 06:15.480
<i>Was I just ignorant?</i>

06:16.030 --> 06:18.580
<i>This is a demon...</i>

06:19.350 --> 06:20.630
<i>This...</i>

06:21.720 --> 06:22.930
<i>is Akutsu?</i>

06:27.130 --> 06:28.200
Akutsu!

06:31.640 --> 06:33.200
<i>Does he not hear me?</i>

06:33.640 --> 06:34.370
He disappeared?

06:48.540 --> 06:49.540
Akutsu!

06:49.990 --> 06:51.430
You have to stop!

07:00.460 --> 07:01.730
<i>Those eyes...</i>

07:07.940 --> 07:11.700
<i>You sure are an amusing demon.</i>

07:13.720 --> 07:17.250
<i>Getting so upset over Lily...</i>

07:22.670 --> 07:23.820
<i>I...</i>

07:50.990 --> 07:55.610
<i>couldn't get angry the way this demon can.</i>

08:01.080 --> 08:02.900
<i>Well...</i>

08:02.900 --> 08:06.310
<i>This is upsetting.</i>

08:11.050 --> 08:13.930
<i>I suppose I was never cut out for this.</i>

08:17.950 --> 08:22.530
<i>It's up to you to do something now.</i>

08:43.620 --> 08:46.660
Yes, it's an urgent matter.

08:46.660 --> 08:48.610
Yes, please do.

08:48.610 --> 08:50.570
I'll send the relevant documents immediately.

08:59.770 --> 09:04.330
The day's finally come to carry this out.

09:08.810 --> 09:10.270
Stop, Akutsu!

09:10.570 --> 09:14.060
If you eliminate Nii-sama now, 
Heaven won't hold back.

09:14.580 --> 09:16.200
They'll be after you!

09:16.490 --> 09:23.290
Besides, Nii-sama may be strict in the way 
he acts, but he's never hurt me physically.

09:24.120 --> 09:25.850
<i>So she knew.</i>

09:25.850 --> 09:27.270
So this is it.

09:27.850 --> 09:30.040
You've beaten Nii-sama.

09:30.040 --> 09:31.040
That's enough.

09:39.450 --> 09:40.760
How dare you!

09:43.340 --> 09:44.700
No, Akutsu!

09:45.100 --> 09:46.960
Get a hold of yourself!

09:46.960 --> 09:48.060
You're...

09:52.840 --> 09:54.740
<i>He isn't hearing me.</i>

09:54.740 --> 09:57.140
<i>I activated the collar...</i>

09:57.140 --> 09:58.530
<i>Is it not working?</i>

10:00.010 --> 10:02.370
<i>Five wings...</i>

10:02.370 --> 10:04.200
<i>I thought he had six.</i>

10:04.200 --> 10:05.650
<i>Since when?</i>

10:05.650 --> 10:07.040
<i>Could it be...</i>

10:11.550 --> 10:12.340
Nii-sama!

10:13.880 --> 10:15.850
Stay with it.

10:15.850 --> 10:16.970
Seriously.

10:17.300 --> 10:21.340
You're such a handful.

10:21.340 --> 10:24.100
I-I'm sorry.

10:24.100 --> 10:25.480
It's fine.

10:25.480 --> 10:27.300
Have you noticed, though?

10:27.300 --> 10:28.940
The wings?

10:28.940 --> 10:29.940
Yeah.

10:29.940 --> 10:32.810
I think they're similar in nature to ours.

10:33.130 --> 10:35.800
They're being used to store energy.

10:36.670 --> 10:40.490
Remember how fast he moved when he stomped me?

10:40.870 --> 10:44.160
He must have focused his energy onto one point,

10:44.160 --> 10:47.700
and used that as propulsion 
to achieve the acceleration he did.

10:47.700 --> 10:51.870
So he's used up a wing's worth of energy.

10:52.880 --> 10:54.170
Th-Then...

10:54.170 --> 10:55.970
If he uses up all his wings, 
he'll come to his senses?

10:55.970 --> 10:57.230
He might.

10:57.230 --> 10:58.840
We just have to hang on until then.

10:58.840 --> 11:00.210
Not a chance.

11:00.210 --> 11:02.780
He's much more physically adept now.

11:02.780 --> 11:04.390
He'll just overpower us.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.770
All right.

11:05.770 --> 11:07.770
I'll deal with four.

11:07.770 --> 11:09.980
It's up to you to take out the last one.

11:10.550 --> 11:13.680
You're going to help me 
bring him to his senses?

11:13.680 --> 11:17.550
Honestly, I'd love to exorcise him.

11:18.210 --> 11:19.150
But...

11:19.710 --> 11:23.220
There's something that bothers me.

11:24.030 --> 11:24.880
Is that...

11:24.880 --> 11:26.790
That's enough talking.

11:27.210 --> 11:27.740
He's coming.

11:42.370 --> 11:43.550
Nii-sama, now!

11:43.550 --> 11:44.470
Fool, look ahead!

11:44.980 --> 11:45.720
No—

11:53.810 --> 11:54.770
Nii-sama!

11:55.130 --> 11:57.720
You got me good there.

11:59.140 --> 12:00.180
But...

12:00.180 --> 12:01.490
I got you.

12:11.900 --> 12:13.670
That seems to be the right idea.

12:16.130 --> 12:17.420
Now, Lily...

12:17.420 --> 12:18.630
It's up to you!

12:18.630 --> 12:19.630
Akutsu!

12:28.030 --> 12:29.090
<i>That's right.</i>

12:30.190 --> 12:32.980
<i>We fought against each
other at first, just like this.</i>

12:33.890 --> 12:37.360
<i>But as we spent more time together,</i>

12:37.360 --> 12:40.470
<i>I came to wonder if maybe there's 
more to it than what I was taught.</i>

12:41.310 --> 12:45.730
<i>I'd never presume to have 
understood you in this short time.</i>

12:46.440 --> 12:48.070
<i>But you...</i>

12:49.240 --> 12:54.440
<i>You're more idiotic, clownish, 
 perverted, stubborn, and...</i>

12:55.060 --> 12:56.810
<i>And more than anything...</i>

12:59.820 --> 13:03.290
<i>You're a kinder man than this.</i>

13:07.750 --> 13:12.890
Go back to normal already, you fool.

13:30.930 --> 13:32.010
Huh.

13:32.010 --> 13:34.200
You really did come to your senses.

13:34.200 --> 13:36.330
So, what are you going to do now?

13:36.330 --> 13:38.650
Should I be prepared to—

13:38.650 --> 13:40.230
Forget that.

13:40.990 --> 13:43.540
I'd regained my hearing at some point.

13:44.270 --> 13:45.660
In bits and pieces.

13:46.130 --> 13:48.680
So I'm not going to do any more to you.

13:50.300 --> 13:51.180
But...

13:51.480 --> 13:55.610
Show up in front of her and make a mess again,

13:55.610 --> 13:57.710
and you'll have to be ready to deal with me.

14:00.890 --> 14:02.370
Noted.

14:02.370 --> 14:03.900
I'll keep that in mind.

14:04.890 --> 14:06.070
Good, then.

14:06.670 --> 14:07.560
But...

14:08.040 --> 14:11.110
I appreciate you snapping me out of it.

14:12.840 --> 14:14.030
Thanks.

14:28.270 --> 14:29.470
<i>Truly...</i>

14:31.080 --> 14:33.300
<i>An amusing demon.</i>

14:40.980 --> 14:43.010
A-All right, here we go.

14:43.010 --> 14:45.090
No wait, I need a countdown.

14:45.090 --> 14:46.860
I'll take it off after the countdown.

14:47.730 --> 14:49.510
The second button.

14:51.640 --> 14:53.590
Three, two...

14:54.030 --> 14:56.750
Three, two, on—

14:58.030 --> 14:59.680
I can't!

14:59.680 --> 15:02.580
There's no way I'm taking a girl's shirt off!

15:03.190 --> 15:06.290
<i>I brought her home because 
she wouldn't wake up...</i>

15:06.290 --> 15:09.570
<i>But her clothes are so damn dirty.</i>

15:09.570 --> 15:13.400
<i>Believe it or not, I'm a germophobe 
when it comes to my bed.</i>

15:13.400 --> 15:16.160
<i>I lose sleep if there's so much as dust around.</i>

15:16.160 --> 15:19.140
<i>And even if I vacuum it up, it's still kinda...</i>

15:19.770 --> 15:23.880
<i>So I need to get rid of her dirty 
clothes somehow, but...</i>

15:24.920 --> 15:26.320
<i>Oh, yeah...</i>

15:28.890 --> 15:33.170
Liliya-san, could you give me a hand?

15:33.170 --> 15:35.000
Hey...

15:39.270 --> 15:40.750
No response.

15:41.650 --> 15:43.150
<i>Seriously?</i>

15:43.150 --> 15:45.000
<i>Do I have to do this?</i>

15:46.100 --> 15:48.030
<i>Do I have to change her?</i>

15:49.010 --> 15:51.650
She's unconscious, you coward!

15:52.450 --> 15:53.860
What's the matter?

15:53.860 --> 15:55.980
She owes us. We saved her.

15:55.980 --> 15:58.550
But it's boring if she doesn't react.

15:58.550 --> 16:00.130
You're right...

16:16.420 --> 16:18.740
What are you doing?

16:18.970 --> 16:19.800
Hey!

16:20.160 --> 16:21.790
What do you mean, what?

16:21.790 --> 16:23.260
To Amane, I mean.

16:23.260 --> 16:25.500
Isn't it obvious?

16:25.950 --> 16:28.090
I'm changing her out of her dirty clothes.

16:28.090 --> 16:29.110
Bam.

16:30.820 --> 16:34.010
<i>Daddy, Daddy, what are they doing on TV?</i>

16:34.010 --> 16:35.810
<i>You're too young for this!</i>

16:42.410 --> 16:43.690
There we go.

16:44.680 --> 16:46.600
A-Are you done?

16:46.600 --> 16:47.450
Yeah.

16:48.300 --> 16:49.900
Why are you hiding?

16:49.900 --> 16:51.110
I mean...

16:52.290 --> 16:55.240
Now, there's something I need 
to talk to you about.

17:00.450 --> 17:02.330
What is it?

17:02.650 --> 17:04.260
I'd rather not do it here.

17:04.260 --> 17:05.490
Come with me.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.840
H-Hey!

17:12.190 --> 17:13.030
Come on.

17:19.380 --> 17:20.940
Is that a rash?

17:22.850 --> 17:24.490
What do you mean?

17:24.490 --> 17:25.920
On your wrist.

17:25.920 --> 17:27.690
Oh, this?

17:28.070 --> 17:30.100
A result of my futile resistance.

17:30.520 --> 17:32.320
Futile resistance?

17:32.320 --> 17:37.110
I tried to come out when Lily-sama 
was defeated by her brother.

17:38.500 --> 17:41.640
Lily-sama, I'm coming!

17:46.880 --> 17:48.160
Why?

17:48.160 --> 17:49.230
Lily-sama!

17:49.230 --> 17:51.260
Please undo these restraints!

17:51.260 --> 17:52.000
Lily-sama!

18:02.180 --> 18:09.400
All I could do was take in the fear and 
sadness flowing into me from Lily-sama.

18:11.440 --> 18:13.790
That's when I received this rash.

18:13.790 --> 18:15.190
Ah...

18:15.190 --> 18:17.630
Hey, so does that mean you were watching?

18:17.630 --> 18:18.750
Watching what?

18:18.750 --> 18:20.290
What happened to me.

18:20.290 --> 18:21.080
Yeah.

18:21.080 --> 18:22.330
I saw all of it.

18:22.330 --> 18:23.850
Then tell me, please.

18:23.850 --> 18:25.110
What did I do?

18:25.560 --> 18:28.110
Why was I fighting Amane?

18:28.110 --> 18:29.250
And...

18:30.220 --> 18:31.870
And how...

18:33.100 --> 18:34.340
How did I seem?

18:36.520 --> 18:37.920
Let's see...

18:37.920 --> 18:41.090
I've seen a fair number of demons.

18:41.660 --> 18:45.870
But you'd be the most revolting of them.

18:48.180 --> 18:50.810
You took joy in trampling your enemies.

18:51.270 --> 18:55.150
And you laughed as you tried to finish 
an enemy that was already incapacitated.

18:55.900 --> 18:59.800
And you even attacked Lily-sama 
when she tried to intervene.

19:00.360 --> 19:03.580
You weren't in your right mind at the time.

19:05.370 --> 19:08.630
I wouldn't have known 
when you first met Lily-sama,

19:08.630 --> 19:11.690
but I can't imagine you'd ever act 
that way of your own volition.

19:12.410 --> 19:15.590
So you needn't let it bother you.

19:16.120 --> 19:17.690
R-Right...

19:17.690 --> 19:19.580
But now that you've told me...

19:19.580 --> 19:21.570
I only told you because you asked.

19:22.110 --> 19:23.480
Right.

19:23.480 --> 19:24.430
Sorry.

19:24.430 --> 19:27.090
What happened to you, though?

19:27.090 --> 19:29.650
I was surprised by the change as well.

19:29.650 --> 19:33.190
I just got so pissed at him...

19:38.600 --> 19:43.410
I regained consciousness at some point, 
but my body wouldn't do what I wanted.

19:46.360 --> 19:48.750
It was like someone had taken it over.

19:49.370 --> 19:51.400
Honestly, I don't know 
how to describe it either.

19:51.930 --> 19:56.090
That's not an excuse for what 
I did to Amane, though, is it?

19:58.030 --> 20:00.730
<i>He really doesn't need to worry about it.</i>

20:03.170 --> 20:06.390
<i>From the moment he jumped in,</i>

20:07.220 --> 20:11.700
<i>it was neither fear nor anger 
that was inside Lily-san.</i>

20:12.580 --> 20:14.900
<i>It was something else entirely.</i>

20:15.900 --> 20:17.450
So...

20:17.450 --> 20:19.570
Didn't you want to talk to me about something?

20:19.970 --> 20:20.990
What was it?

20:20.990 --> 20:22.570
Oh, that's right.

20:22.970 --> 20:25.320
There's something I wanted to tell you.

20:25.320 --> 20:26.420
What's that?

20:27.150 --> 20:32.750
You must have noticed that Lily-sama 
is struggling in Heaven.

20:33.560 --> 20:34.410
Yeah.

20:35.160 --> 20:37.090
She isn't being bullied, isn't she?

20:37.490 --> 20:43.030
Her family were very strict people 
by the time I came to her.

20:44.310 --> 20:48.610
Ever since she was little, 
Lily-sama has understood her situation.

20:48.610 --> 20:52.140
No matter what kind of injustice she was 
made to suffer, she simply endured it.

20:53.980 --> 20:57.060
And in order to win even just 
a little bit of approval,

20:57.060 --> 20:59.460
and in order to survive in her world...

20:59.460 --> 21:02.580
Lily-sama worked hard in all kinds of ways.

21:02.900 --> 21:04.200
Desperately.

21:05.430 --> 21:10.690
You must be aware of 
how intelligent and kind she is.

21:11.620 --> 21:14.930
That's how she finally 
achieved her current position.

21:14.930 --> 21:16.030
And you...

21:16.670 --> 21:20.040
You completely shattered it!

21:20.040 --> 21:23.800
Even when her brother confronted her, 
she could have overcome it.

21:24.140 --> 21:25.970
Just as she always has!

21:26.680 --> 21:27.930
And yet, you...

21:28.300 --> 21:28.930
You...

21:28.930 --> 21:29.970
You...

21:39.700 --> 21:41.780
You jumped in front of her...

21:43.030 --> 21:47.860
You defeated her, 
and now she has nowhere to go.

21:48.730 --> 21:50.190
Nowhere!

21:53.380 --> 21:54.310
So...

22:07.100 --> 22:08.330
Thank you.
